{"title":"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/4466063bd3f6e169907b97df038c5ab50dcf70d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(-2) = \\nabla + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/53196dddfbaf8145fd14be11cf568c5154588ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\nabla$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/a/0fa754641a806407caeca46a9f541b2034013ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ -8 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ -6 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"477\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/4466063bd3f6e169907b97df038c5ab50dcf70d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(-2) = \\nabla + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/e/78e14a7259226e941b4a5c7f7f70d4a3f2953ba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\nabla + 2 = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195fc25105e44f960a511afe8798375b960d50db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\nabla = -6 - 2 = \\boxed{\\text {(C) } -8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"193\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Lgnjqr28Lnk?si=DNCaR-6iJx47HHPT&amp;t=50\">https://youtu.be/Lgnjqr28Lnk?si=DNCaR-6iJx47HHPT&amp;t=50</a> (also includes problems 1, 2, and 4-10)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley\">2009 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 CEMC 